<title>CANADA: Tesco Corp shares to trade on Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Tesco Corp shares to trade on Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian oilfield technology firm Tesco Corp said on Friday its shares would begin trading on Nasdaq on December 2.</p>
<p>Tesco, now traded on the Toronto Stock Exchange, said its shares would be listed on Nasdaq under the symbol TESOF.  </p>
<p>The company manufactures, sells and rents hydraulic and electric top drives for installation on onshore and offshore drilling rigs.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
